{"schemaVersion":1,"id":-40001,"sections":[{"id":"script-20001","name":"原始脚本 20001","scripts":[20001],"start":0,"count":29}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20001:20001:1","scriptId":20001,"text":"死水基地——波西娅博士的实验室","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20001:20001:2","scriptId":20001,"text":"虽然还是早晨，但此时的研究室已经能见到不少钢舞姬聚集着，看来已经有其他小队早早到达了现场。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20001:20001:3","scriptId":20001,"text":"“接到征召任务特地赶来，没想到已经有那么多人到了啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20001:20001:4","scriptId":20001,"text":"征召任务都是由死水基地直接发起的，作为死水佣兵的一员，没有人可以拒绝这种任务。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20001:20001:5","scriptId":20001,"text":"一般都是重大事件，又或者是内容极为特殊的任务。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20001:20001:6","scriptId":20001,"text":"今天看来是后者，因为毕竟是波西娅博士发起的征召。和她打交道那么久了，从她这边接受的任务从来就没有普通过。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":574,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20001:20001:7","scriptId":20001,"text":"“哦呀～那个不是扎莉吗，这个任务难道很难吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":574,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20001:20001:8","scriptId":20001,"text":"“扎莉就是那个黑色闪电小队的？有听说过，很强是吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":584,"right":574,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":572,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20001:20001:9","scriptId":20001,"text":"“恩，至少和蕾贝卡的沙狐小队同等水平。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":584,"right":572,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20001:20001:10","scriptId":20001,"text":"“另一支呢？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":584,"right":572,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":572,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20001:20001:11","scriptId":20001,"text":"“我看看……那身红色军服，人类指挥官。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":584,"right":572,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":578,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20001:20001:12","scriptId":20001,"text":"“哦～～看来和我们这边一样呢～死水唯二的人类指挥官小队今天都到齐了啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":584,"right":578,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20001:20001:13","scriptId":20001,"text":"“不要把我们说得像稀有动物一样……反正只要集中完成任务就行了，协同其他小队作战也挺好。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":578,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":591,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20001:20001:14","scriptId":20001,"text":"“希望是这样。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":591,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20001:20001:15","scriptId":20001,"text":"正当我们还在你一句我一句的闲扯时，征召任务的主催者——波西娅登场了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":591,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20001:20001:16","scriptId":20001,"text":"仍旧是那身白大褂，身上飘逸着药水试剂的特殊味道。波西娅缓缓地走到众人面前，所有人的焦点立刻投向她。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":591,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20001:20001:17","scriptId":20001,"text":"“今天征召你们三支队伍来主要是为了让你们协助我的研究工作～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20001:20001:18","scriptId":20001,"text":"“跟我来吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20001:20001:19","scriptId":20001,"text":"波西娅打开了后方仓库的大门，内部充满着各种大型的机械。随后波西娅走了进去，同时也示意后面的人跟着她。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20001:20001:20","scriptId":20001,"text":"“这是我的新研究成果，模拟战斗交换机。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20001:20001:21","scriptId":20001,"text":"“把我收集到的数据整合到一起，通过这台机器进行模拟，转换出新的数据报告书。新的报告书又可以转换成舞装生成公式，也可以模拟舞装的种种可能性。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20001:20001:22","scriptId":20001,"text":"“通过演算还能——”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":632,"speaker":"扎莉·魏特曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20001:20001:23","scriptId":20001,"text":"“好的好的，很厉害的机械呢。那么我们应该做什么呢？时间宝贵。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":632,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20001:20001:24","scriptId":20001,"text":"扎莉打断了准备大谈阔论的波西娅。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":632,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20001:20001:25","scriptId":20001,"text":"波西娅愤愤地瞪了一眼扎莉，不过她这次倒没有继续发作，而是切入了主题。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":632,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20001:20001:26","scriptId":20001,"text":"“你们先坐到那排座椅上，我将把你们的数据扫描下来～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":632,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":640,"speaker":"扎莉·魏特曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20001:20001:27","scriptId":20001,"text":"“早说嘛，那么就坐上去吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":640,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20001:20001:28","scriptId":20001,"text":"于是众人就坐上了那些位于大型机械下方的座椅，一个头罩慢慢扣了下来，罩住了我们的头部。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":640,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20001:20001:29","scriptId":20001,"text":"“那就开始了哟～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":640,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
